  "description": "Teammachine SLR 01 FOUR keeps the Teammachine formula intact, making it the perfect climbing bike with the same iconic design, and stiff yet responsive ride feel shaped in our Impec Lab to be lighter, sharper, and faster than ever.\nIts refined carbon layup using our 01 Pro Carbon grade is unapologetically stiff, giving exceptional power transfer on the uphills and sharp handling on the downs. It’s light where it counts, aero where it matters, and engineered in a package that opens up BMC SLR 01 level to more riders.\nTCC Race compliance adds smoothness without compromising on stiffness, giving it that unmistakable BMC confidence across every road surface.\nA Shimano Dura-Ace Di2 drivetrain, 4iiii Precision power meter, ICS Carbon Evo one-piece full carbon cockpit, and CR 40 SL Carbon tubeless-ready wheels complete a build made for decisive efforts in the mountains.",
